Project-Demonstration
: Problem Identification
Objective: Identify the difficulties students face in conventional learning.
•	Students often struggle to get instant answers to academic questions.
•	Learning materials may be scattered across different sources.
•	Students need personalized explanations based on their learning level.
•	Teachers may not have enough time to provide individual assistance.
•	A conversational AI assistant can provide interactive, on-demand learning support.
Project idea:
EduGenie is an AI-powered learning assistant that uses Google Gemini to help students understand concepts, ask questions, generate study materials, and interact with educational content.
________________________________________
Phase 2: Requirement Analysis
Functional requirements:
1.	Student registration/login.
2.	Ask questions through a chat interface.
3.	Generate explanations for academic topics.
4.	Summarize learning materials.
5.	Generate quizzes and practice questions.
6.	Provide step-by-step explanations.
7.	Maintain conversation history.
8.	Support multiple subjects/topics.
9.	Provide personalized learning assistance.
Non-functional requirements:
•	Simple and responsive interface.
•	Fast response time.
•	Secure user authentication.
•	Reliable AI responses.
•	Scalable architecture.
